<title>USA: TENNIS-HAMLET CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HAMLET CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, New York 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Hamlet Cup men's tennis tournament on Monday (Prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>4-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat David Prinosil</p>
<p>(Germany) 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
